  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "[Fix] forward redefined properties to their redefining property instead of throwing; fixes #232\n            [Fix] generate derived composite properties as List instead of IContainerList; fixes #286\n            [Fix] implement Element.OwnedElement derived property; fixes #288\n            [Improvement] return IReadOnlyList for derived/read-only collection properties; fixes #291\n            [Feature] read any UML element as an XMI document root; part of #77\n            [Fix] read value and skipped elements in place so compact XMI is read completely; fixes #362\n            [Fix] parse Boolean, Integer and Real values per XML Schema lexical forms; fixes #364\n            [Fix] write enumeration values with the literal names of the UML metamodel; fixes #376\n            [Fix] ignore serialized derived properties instead of throwing in strict mode; fixes #367\n            [Fix] report invalid enumeration literals, repeated single-valued references and duplicate xmi:id with element, property and position; fixes #371\n            [Fix] Property::isComposite is aggregation = composite only; the Enterprise Architect accommodation moves to QueryIsContainment; fixes #345\n            [Fix] set the owner end of a composite association on containment, and do not write it; fixes #432\n            [Breaking] optional [0..1] Boolean, Integer, Real and Enumeration properties are nullable; fixes #357, fixes #347\n            [Breaking] derived composite properties are exposed as IReadOnlyList; fixes #358\n            [Fix] untyped elements produce valid C# type names; fixes #395\n            [Fix] the writer always writes a mandatory value without a metamodel default; fixes #375\n            [Feature] the writer can write Canonical XMI (XMI 2.5.1 Annex B) with the UseCanonicalXmi setting; fixes #385\n            [Improvement] single-valued composite properties enforce their upper bound; fixes #480",
